1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,336
In 2023, SK hynix

2
00:00:02,356 --> 00:00:04,453
lost ₩7.7 trillion

3
00:00:04,473 --> 00:00:07,698
Chips weren't selling, so every hour of production lost money

4
00:00:07,718 --> 00:00:11,898
Then ₩23 trillion in 2024, ₩47 trillion in 2025

5
00:00:11,918 --> 00:00:15,200
And in Q2 this year, ₩60 trillion in just three months

6
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,121
The hero of this turnaround is HBM, high-bandwidth memory

7
00:00:18,141 --> 00:00:23,030
It sits right next to AI chips and moves data extremely fast

8
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:27,206
Nvidia uses HBM in its AI chips, and SK hynix leads that market

9
00:00:27,226 --> 00:00:32,023
In 2025, for the first time, it earned more operating profit than all of Samsung Electronics

10
00:00:32,043 --> 00:00:35,173
But times like this are exactly when you should revisit the past

11
00:00:35,193 --> 00:00:40,279
After record earnings in 2018, 87% of profit disappeared

12
00:00:40,299 --> 00:00:43,537
How far will this turnaround go? Find out in the full video

13
00:00:43,557 --> 00:00:46,409
